OL,3,GNEWSAIslanders urged to boil water over
OL,4,Aquality issues
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople on one of the Isles of Scilly
OL,7,Fhave been urged to boil their water
OL,8,Fafter routine testing.
OL,10,FDescribed it as "precautionary", South
OL,11,FWest Water said it had issued the
OL,12,Fwarning on Bryher after results from
OL,13,Fwater quality monitoring.
OL,15,FThe water company said "protecting
OL,16,Fpublic health remains our priority" and
OL,17,Fbottled water was available for
OL,18,Fresidents from the Church Quay waiting
OL,19,Froom.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
