OL,3,GNEWSAIslanders urged to boil water over
OL,4,Aquality issues
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth West Water added: "We are sorry
OL,7,Ffor the inconvenience this has caused
OL,8,Fand thank customers for their patience
OL,9,Fand understanding."
